OL,3,ASwedish sword attack victim was
OL,4,A17-year-old girl, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victim of a deadly sword attack at
OL,7,Fa high school in central Sweden was a
OL,8,F17-year-old girl, police have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FTwo boys aged 12 and 17 were also
OL,12,Fseriously injured in the attack at
OL,13,FBrinell School in Fagersta on Friday
OL,14,Fafternoon, according to local
OL,15,Fauthorities, while a third person
OL,16,Fsustained minor injuries.
OL,18,FAn 18-year-old man, who has not been
OL,19,Fnamed, was arrested and police said
OL,20,Fthey were treating the case as murder
OL,21,Fand attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
